@node Orchestration and Terminal
@chapter Orchestration and Terminal
@anchor{orchestration}
@cindex orchestration
@cindex terminal

This chapter covers the command surface itself: the two menus that reach
every command, the terminal subsystem that runs agents and interactive
CLIs, the Dolt and repository commands, configuration, and the audit and
provenance views.  The day-to-day issue commands are in @ref{Issue
Workflow}, the views in @ref{Dashboards and Views}, and the build and
extension guide in @ref{Maintenance and Extending}.

