@node The Dispatch and Maintenance Menus
@section The Dispatch and Maintenance Menus
@anchor{dispatch-menu}
@cindex dispatch menu
@cindex maintenance menu

The whole CLI surface is reachable from two menus.

@deffn Command beads-dispatch
Open the dispatch menu on @kbd{?}: the high- and mid-frequency commands,
grouped into @strong{Issues}, @strong{Workflow}, @strong{Views}, and
@strong{Manage}.  The menu is opened from any beads buffer with @kbd{?};
a context group is built from the view at point.
@end deffn

@deffn Command beads-maintenance
Open the maintenance menu on @kbd{!}: the low-frequency, admin, and
infrastructure commands.  It replaces the former @code{beads-ops-menu}
and @code{beads-advanced-menu}, which no longer exist.
@end deffn

@defvr {User Option} beads-menu-providers
List of functions that append extra groups to the dispatch menu.
Downstream packages (for example gascity.el) register their own group here
so it appears under the dispatch menu without editing beads.el.
@end defvr

